{"unit_id":"guchang__draw2code#card-zh","repo":"guchang/draw2code","commit":"5b1437847c191c61180a147c163160e9f99c4982","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Draw2Code（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：帮助用户把产品想法整理成可协作编辑的低保真原型，并据此生成前端页面。它在 DSH 的 better-sidebar 右侧栏注册 Excalidraw 画布，同时提供 Agent 工具来澄清需求、读取和修改画板、生成页面。主要功能包括自适应产品需求提问、多画板协作编辑、页面结构与交互原型绘制，以及按选定页面生成可预览的 HTML。适合需要先讨论产品范围、再与 Agent 一起画原型并验证页面方向的产品设计和开发场景。需要 DSH Web、dsh-better-sidebar 及 Node.js 22 或更高版本；没有额外 API Key 配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:84-93","src/client/index.tsx:31-62","src/create-tool.ts:458-471","src/tools.ts:2694-2701"]}
{"unit_id":"guchang__draw2code#card-en","repo":"guchang/draw2code","commit":"5b1437847c191c61180a147c163160e9f99c4982","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Draw2Code is a DSH web plugin with an Excalidraw canvas in the right sidebar. Agent tools clarify product needs, edit boards, and generate HTML demos from selected prototype pages. It supports collaborative prototyping before frontend work and requires DSH Web, dsh-better-sidebar, and Node.js 22+.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:84-93","src/client/index.tsx:31-62","src/create-tool.ts:458-471","src/tools.ts:2694-2701"]}
