{"unit_id":"guchang__draw2code#feature-1","repo":"guchang/draw2code","commit":"5b1437847c191c61180a147c163160e9f99c4982","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Draw2Code 的功能「需求澄清与简报」：用户提出新产品想法后，Agent 通过自适应问题补齐产品决策，并把确认后的结构化信息整理成项目简报。用户可以回答、跳过或修改问题，确认简报后才创建画板。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/create-tool.ts:458-471","src/create-tool.ts:620-680"]}
{"unit_id":"guchang__draw2code#feature-2","repo":"guchang/draw2code","commit":"5b1437847c191c61180a147c163160e9f99c4982","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Draw2Code 的功能「协作原型画板」：在 DSH 右侧栏打开 Excalidraw 画布，用户可直接编辑，Agent 通过列表、读取和更新工具同步操作。画板按工作区保存，更新支持版本冲突检测与复核流程。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.tsx:31-62","src/client/CanvasPanel.tsx:1-12","src/tools.ts:989-1050","src/scene-store.ts:1335-1424"]}
{"unit_id":"guchang__draw2code#feature-3","repo":"guchang/draw2code","commit":"5b1437847c191c61180a147c163160e9f99c4982","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Draw2Code 的功能「按原型生成页面」：用户确认原型后选择要生成的页面并提供视觉方向，Agent 按流程生成单文件 HTML。完成前需提供预览截图、DOM 与布局检查等结构化验收证据。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:2694-2701"]}
{"unit_id":"guchang__draw2code#feature-4","repo":"guchang/draw2code","commit":"5b1437847c191c61180a147c163160e9f99c4982","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Draw2Code 的功能「多画板管理」：画布读取当前工作区中的画板列表，并支持按名称读取单块画板；用户可以在侧栏切换不同原型，列表会提供各画板的更新时间和元素数量。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:989-1050","src/scene-store.ts:1335-1407"]}
{"unit_id":"guchang__draw2code#caveat-1","repo":"guchang/draw2code","commit":"5b1437847c191c61180a147c163160e9f99c4982","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"Draw2Code 将画板和项目简报保存在当前工作区的 draw2code 目录，并将生成的页面写入 draw2code-pages；需要在对应工作区中查看这些产物。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/project-store.ts:10-14","src/scene-store.ts:1335-1377"]}
